From: Chen Jun <newdays-cj@live.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:57:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH v2 5/8] docs: document arm64 boot-time HugeTLB vmemmap
 optimization

Describe the supported boot configuration, reservation ordering, fallback
behavior and existing HVO control. Explain the avoided backing-page
count without presenting it as whole-system peak-memory measurement.

Document the isolated QEMU regression runner, required configuration,
NUMA and rejected-request cases, lifecycle assertions and explicit skip
or failure results.

Signed-off-by: Chen Jun <newdays-cj@live.com>
Co-authored-by: sisyphus-dev-ai <sisyphus-dev-ai@users.noreply.github.com>
